## {{BLANK_1_TITLE}}
{{CONTEXT_BLANK_1_NARRATIVE}}

{{CONTEXT_CODE_TRACING_INTRO}}
{{CONTEXT_LEARNING_OBJECTIVE}}

עקבי אחרי פעולות על מילון כדי להבין כיצד
מילון שומר ומאחזר נתונים.

## {{TRACE_1_TITLE}}
{{CONTEXT_TRACE_1_NARRATIVE}}

scores = {"{{hero}}": 10, "{{heroine}}": 20}
winner = ""
if scores["{{hero}}"] > scores["{{heroine}}"]:
    winner = "{{hero}}"
else:
    winner = "{{heroine}}"
scores[winner] = scores[winner] + 5
print(f"Winner: {winner}")
print(f"New score: {scores[winner]}")

{{CONTEXT_CODE_TRACING_INTRO}}
{{CONTEXT_LEARNING_OBJECTIVE}}

עקבי אחרי שינויים במילוניות כדי להבין כיצד
מילוניות משתנות לאורך מספר פעולות.

## {{TRACE_1_TITLE}}
{{CONTEXT_TRACE_1_NARRATIVE}}

scores = {}
players = ["{{hero}}", "{{heroine}}", "{{hero}}"]
for player in players:
    scores[player] = scores.get(player, 0) + 10
print(scores)

data = {"a": 1, "b": 2, "c": 3}
total = 0
for key in data:
    if data[key] > 1:
        total = total + data[key]
print(f"Total: {total}")

profiles = {
    "{{hero}}": {"level": 5},
    "{{heroine}}": {"level": 7}
}
for name in profiles:
    profiles[name]["level"] = profiles[name]["level"] + 1
print(profiles["{{hero}}"]["level"])
print(profiles["{{heroine}}"]["level"])

